    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d125">

                <pb facs="0437" n="379" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg379"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Senor Romero to Mr. Hunter</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Legation</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 5, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister of the Mexican republic presents his compliments to William Hunter,
                    esq., and has the honor to transmit several late articles from the Paris press
                    relating to Mexican affairs and containing important information, showing the
                    change of public opinion in France in regard to that delicate question.</p>









